WEBVTT

00:00:07.508 --> 00:00:09.510
[barking]

00:00:15.808 --> 00:00:17.810
[panting]

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:22.190
[contented grunting]

00:00:22.232 --> 00:00:24.399
[howls softly]

00:00:29.322 --> 00:00:30.447
[bowl clatters]

00:00:30.489 --> 00:00:32.449
[groans]

00:00:32.491 --> 00:00:34.744
[gulps]

00:00:34.785 --> 00:00:36.411
[yowls]

00:00:40.499 --> 00:00:41.458
[gentle classical music playing]

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.586
You be a good boy, Leonard. MAN:

00:00:43.627 --> 00:00:45.462
[door closes]

00:00:45.504 --> 00:00:48.007
♪ Jump! ♪ [loud rock music playing]

00:00:48.049 --> 00:00:50.093
♪ Bounce! ♪

00:00:50.385 --> 00:00:52.678
[rock music continues in distance]

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:55.014
[Chloe screams] [crash]

00:00:55.056 --> 00:00:56.599
Hey, Max.

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.311
Hey, Chloe, do you ever wonder where they go during the day?

00:01:00.353 --> 00:01:01.478
Do you know what? I just...

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:03.480
I don't really care. [grunting]

00:01:03.522 --> 00:01:04.774
what it's like for you, Maybe that's

00:01:04.815 --> 00:01:07.110
a different relationship. but Katie and I have

00:01:07.151 --> 00:01:09.237
You know, you're-you're a cat, so maybe that's why,

00:01:09.279 --> 00:01:12.115
'cause nobody could ever love a cat the way they love a dog.

00:01:12.156 --> 00:01:14.117
Maybe that's why. I'm just sayin'.

00:01:14.158 --> 00:01:16.619
Whatever you need to tell yourself.

00:01:16.660 --> 00:01:18.454
[grunts]

00:01:20.539 --> 00:01:22.499
[purring] [Sweetpea chirping]

00:01:22.541 --> 00:01:25.128
Hey, morning, Max! MAX: Hey, guys.

00:01:25.169 --> 00:01:27.504
What's up, Sweetpea?

00:01:27.546 --> 00:01:29.882
Hey, Mel, where you been, man?

00:01:29.924 --> 00:01:31.508
Oh! Get this!

00:01:31.550 --> 00:01:34.470
Last Sunday, my owner feeds me a small white pill, right?

00:01:34.511 --> 00:01:36.472
I start to feel a little groggy.

00:01:36.513 --> 00:01:39.516
I wake up, I'm in the sky! The next thing I know,

00:01:39.558 --> 00:01:40.559
The s... the sky? Wait a minute.

00:01:40.601 --> 00:01:42.228
Yeah, there are suitcases everywhere.

00:01:42.270 --> 00:01:44.563
I'm locked up in a crate. [laughs] Come on.

00:01:44.605 --> 00:01:45.940
There are suitcases in the sky?

00:01:45.982 --> 00:01:48.443
Yeah, so I pass out from fear, and when I wake up,

00:01:48.484 --> 00:01:49.652
I'm in Florida!

00:01:49.693 --> 00:01:51.570
Um, this did not happen.

00:01:51.612 --> 00:01:53.781
a pill like that again. I will never eat

00:01:53.823 --> 00:01:55.532
Unless it's covered in peanut butter.

00:01:55.574 --> 00:01:58.119
Because, I mean, come on! Right? It's peanut butter!

00:01:58.161 --> 00:01:59.870
[clattering]

00:01:59.912 --> 00:02:02.539
-Oh, hey, Norman. -Hey, guys!

00:02:02.581 --> 00:02:04.541
for your apartment? You still looking

00:02:04.583 --> 00:02:06.419
Yeah. Going on three weeks now.

00:02:06.461 --> 00:02:08.545
or the third floor? Is this the second

00:02:08.587 --> 00:02:11.590
but, uh, you don't live here. I don't know any numbers,

00:02:11.632 --> 00:02:12.967
Aw, pellets!

00:02:13.009 --> 00:02:15.970
Well, see you guys later!

00:02:16.012 --> 00:02:17.805
You know what? You can do it!

00:02:17.847 --> 00:02:20.350
Can't do it. [whispers]

00:02:20.391 --> 00:02:22.559
Buddy! Th-There you are!

00:02:22.601 --> 00:02:23.602
D-Did you find it?

00:02:23.644 --> 00:02:26.314
[chuckles] You know I did!

00:02:27.064 --> 00:02:29.025
Voilá! [toy squeaks]

00:02:29.066 --> 00:02:31.610
-Ball! Ball, ball, ball! -Ball! [laughing]

00:02:31.652 --> 00:02:33.821
Katie's gonna be so excited! MAX:

00:02:33.863 --> 00:02:35.698
like the one she lost! Th-This is exactly

00:02:35.739 --> 00:02:37.158
-I mean, look at it. -Ooh!

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:39.785
it fits in my mouth. It's round,

00:02:39.827 --> 00:02:40.786
DOGS: Ball!

00:02:40.828 --> 00:02:42.330
Yeah! Hee-hee-hee!

00:02:42.372 --> 00:02:43.580
[chuckles]

00:02:43.622 --> 00:02:44.874
Ooh.

00:02:47.335 --> 00:02:48.336
[yowls]

00:02:48.378 --> 00:02:51.588
[crashing, thumping, Chloe meowing]

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:53.757
There is no other ball in the city

00:02:53.799 --> 00:02:55.592
[chuckles] like this one ball.

00:02:55.634 --> 00:02:57.845
Guaranteed, this is the ball.

00:02:57.887 --> 00:03:00.223
[excited meowing]

00:03:00.264 --> 00:03:01.724
[crashing]

00:03:01.765 --> 00:03:04.060
♪ ♪

00:03:06.645 --> 00:03:07.855
[keys jingle, lock rattles]

00:03:07.897 --> 00:03:09.732
KATIE: Hey! [gasps] Katie!

00:03:09.773 --> 00:03:11.608
I'm home, Max! [barking]

00:03:11.650 --> 00:03:13.403
Hey, Maximilian!

00:03:13.444 --> 00:03:16.613
How was your day, buddy? That's a good boy!

00:03:16.655 --> 00:03:19.616
Ah, yes, I'm so psyched to see you, too, buddy.

00:03:19.658 --> 00:03:21.618
[door thumps] Okay, boy, calm down.

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:23.620
It's okay. Let's all be calm.

00:03:23.662 --> 00:03:26.332
Now, I have some... big news.

00:03:26.374 --> 00:03:28.376
[grunts] I know this'll take [door thumping]

00:03:28.418 --> 00:03:31.546
some getting used to, but... but I think it's gonna be

00:03:31.587 --> 00:03:33.548
a great thing in the long...

00:03:33.589 --> 00:03:34.715
Oh!

00:03:34.757 --> 00:03:37.468
Max, this is Duke!

00:03:37.510 --> 00:03:39.136
[gasps]

00:03:39.178 --> 00:03:42.639
He's going to be your... brother.

00:03:42.681 --> 00:03:44.058
[growls]

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:45.642
[Duke whimpers] No, no, Max.

00:03:45.684 --> 00:03:48.354
It's gonna be all right, Duke. Okay. [sighs]

00:03:48.396 --> 00:03:50.773
It's okay.

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:53.650
[sniffing]

00:03:53.692 --> 00:03:54.777
[barks]

00:03:56.987 --> 00:04:00.283
Aw, see? He likes you.

00:04:00.324 --> 00:04:02.118
[spitting]

00:04:02.159 --> 00:04:04.120
[laughs] Whoa! Oh! [Duke barks]

00:04:04.161 --> 00:04:06.789
Aw. Yeah, that's it, Duke. [laughing]

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:08.749
Take a look around.

00:04:08.791 --> 00:04:10.251
[clattering] [Katie sighs]

00:04:10.293 --> 00:04:12.878
This is a lot to take in. I know, buddy.

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:15.131
But... he didn't have a home.

00:04:15.172 --> 00:04:18.301
have to take care of him. So you and I are gonna

00:04:18.342 --> 00:04:19.469
[grunts] Okay?

00:04:19.510 --> 00:04:20.677
[toy squeaking]

00:04:20.719 --> 00:04:22.846
[gasps] Oh, my gosh! KATIE:

00:04:22.888 --> 00:04:24.765
Duke found our lost ball!

00:04:24.807 --> 00:04:26.976
What a great team we're gonna be!

00:04:27.017 --> 00:04:28.685
[ball pops, sputters]

00:04:28.727 --> 00:04:30.396
[Max sputters]

00:04:30.438 --> 00:04:32.940
♪ ♪

00:04:35.734 --> 00:04:37.528
[panting]

00:04:37.570 --> 00:04:39.155
[Max growls]

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:45.661
Love you, Maxie.

00:04:47.746 --> 00:04:49.873
Love you, Duke.

00:04:55.754 --> 00:04:58.132
Sleep tight, boys. Mwah!

00:05:00.759 --> 00:05:02.261
Psst.

00:05:03.304 --> 00:05:04.679
Psst.

00:05:05.764 --> 00:05:07.724
Hey. Little guy. [whispering]

00:05:07.766 --> 00:05:10.227
This place is so great!

00:05:10.269 --> 00:05:11.562
Uh-huh.

00:05:11.604 --> 00:05:15.483
that is one gorgeous bed. By the way, that is...

00:05:15.525 --> 00:05:16.817
Yeah. It's okay.

00:05:16.859 --> 00:05:18.235
Maybe we could share.

00:05:18.277 --> 00:05:20.237
one night you get the bed, You know,

00:05:20.279 --> 00:05:22.739
the next night I do, that kind of thing.

00:05:22.781 --> 00:05:24.617
You know, this bed is mine.

00:05:24.659 --> 00:05:27.495
You? You get an old blanket. Th-That suits you.

00:05:27.537 --> 00:05:29.746
You're an old blanket kind of a dog.

00:05:29.788 --> 00:05:31.748
[laughs] Oh, wow.

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:33.376
You are stubborn!

00:05:33.417 --> 00:05:34.502
Hey, I-I get it.

00:05:34.544 --> 00:05:36.504
But we got to learn I'm stubborn, too.

00:05:36.546 --> 00:05:38.214
-Wait. What are you... -to get along.

00:05:38.255 --> 00:05:40.757
in this bed if we really try. I'll bet we can both fit

00:05:40.799 --> 00:05:42.717
-Let me scoot on in there. -No, no. No, wait.

00:05:42.759 --> 00:05:45.804
Ah. Perfect. This is comfy, [muffled yelling] right?

00:05:45.846 --> 00:05:47.806
No, it is not! [muffled]

00:05:47.848 --> 00:05:49.308
MAX: Aah! [sighs]

00:05:49.350 --> 00:05:50.601
I'm comfy.

00:05:52.562 --> 00:05:54.647
Duke is just ruining our lives! He's ruining...

00:05:54.689 --> 00:05:57.858
that you get rid of this dog! It's an emergency

00:05:57.900 --> 00:05:58.526
He stole my...

00:05:58.568 --> 00:06:00.110
[barking excitedly]

00:06:01.445 --> 00:06:03.197
and he's frightening ...and he's scary

00:06:03.239 --> 00:06:05.199
of all good things. and he's the death

00:06:05.241 --> 00:06:07.284
Aw, you little cutie pie! KATIE:

00:06:07.326 --> 00:06:09.537
We'll play tomorrow, buddy, okay?

00:06:09.579 --> 00:06:11.664
Okay, sleep well.

00:06:11.706 --> 00:06:14.791
[gasps] Are you trying to get rid of me?

00:06:14.833 --> 00:06:16.085
Before I answer that,

00:06:16.126 --> 00:06:19.046
how much you heard. I-I'd like to know

00:06:19.088 --> 00:06:20.923
it's gonna be, huh? So that's how

00:06:20.964 --> 00:06:23.175
are you making me angry! Oh, man,

00:06:23.217 --> 00:06:26.345
And when I get angry, I do this!

00:06:26.387 --> 00:06:27.846
[growling]

00:06:27.888 --> 00:06:29.515
And I don't want to do that!

00:06:29.557 --> 00:06:32.767
and if it's gonna come down I need this place,

00:06:32.809 --> 00:06:35.521
to you or me, it's gonna be me!

00:06:35.563 --> 00:06:36.522
[fierce bark]

00:06:36.564 --> 00:06:38.190
Aah!

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:43.362
[sighs]

00:06:47.866 --> 00:06:50.202
[Duke grunts softly]

00:06:59.878 --> 00:07:01.796
[Max whimpers]

00:07:07.886 --> 00:07:10.264
[Duke snoring]

00:07:14.893 --> 00:07:17.062
♪ ♪

